      <title>Binance Resumes Customer Withdrawals in Phases After Record Hack</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-01/binance-to-resume-customer-withdrawals-in-phases-after-hack</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f41d5a3381c9db9471ea318e</guid>
